# RetailEX — portable / desktop release marka koruması

AsinERP Portable yanlışlıkla RetailEX releases’a düşmesin. Ürün ayrımı: `asin-retailex-product-separation.mdc`.

## Remote kontrol (zorunlu — her tag / release öncesi)

`app-v*`, `portable-v*`, `portable-soft-v*`, `android-v*` push veya `gh release` / `gh workflow run` **öncesi**:

1. `git remote -v` → **`origin`** URL’sinde **`RetailEX`** olmalı.
2. `origin` **`asin`** ise: **dur** — AsinERP işi yalnızca `ferhatdeveloper/asin` kökünde (`C:\Users\FERHAT\Desktop\asin`).
3. Yanlış repoya tag, asset veya workflow tetikleme **yasak**.

## RetailEX Actions / GitHub Release — yasak

| Yasak | Örnek |
|-------|--------|
| AsinERP asset adı | `AsinERP-Portable-*.zip`, `AsinERP-Desktop-Setup-*.exe`, `AsinERP-Android-*.apk` |
| AsinERP release title / body | `AsinERP Portable …` |
| Asin portable workflow / script | `desktop-portable-release.yml` (Asin), `pack-asin-portable-zip.mjs` |
| Asin tag’ini RetailEX’e push | `portable-v*` / `app-v*` yanlış origin’e |

## RetailEX portable

Yalnızca **bu** repoda ve **RetailEX** markasıyla:

| Öğe | Full (müşteri / hizmet) | Soft (deneme) |
|-----|-------------------------|---------------|
| Asset | `RetailEX-{version}.exe` | `RetailEX-Soft-{version}.zip` |
| Tag | `portable-v{version}` | `portable-soft-v{version}` |
| Release adı | `RetailEX {version}` | `RetailEX Soft {version}` |
| Pack | `pack-retailex-portable-zip.mjs` + NSIS | aynı + `--soft` / `--zip` |
| Tetikleme | `npm run desktop:portable:ci:build` | `npm run desktop:portable:ci:build:soft` |
| Güncelleme | `RetailEX_Tools.exe update` (yalnızca Full EXE) | Soft ZIP güncelleme kanalı değil |

Workflow: `.github/workflows/desktop-portable-release.yml` — input `profile`: `full` \| `soft` \| `both`.

DeskApp NSIS kurulum: `RetailEX-Desktop-Setup-{version}.exe` + tag `app-v{version}` (`retailex-desktop-release-filename.mdc`).

Terazi yardımcı portable: `RetailEX.TeraziManager-Portable-{version}.zip` — yine RetailEX markası; AsinERP değil.

## Asin portable — yalnızca asin repo

- Repo: `https://github.com/ferhatdeveloper/asin`
- Asset: `AsinERP-Portable-{version}.zip`
- Workflow: `.github/workflows/desktop-portable-release.yml` (Asin)
- RetailEX workspace’te Asin portable tetikleme / zip yükleme / release oluşturma **yasak**

## Ajan checklist

- [ ] `origin` = RetailEX mi doğrulandı?
- [ ] Release asset / title’da `AsinERP` yok mu?
- [ ] Full `RetailEX-….exe` / Soft `RetailEX-Soft-….zip` mi (AsinERP yok)?
- [ ] CI yalnızca doküman/kural değişikliğinde tetiklenmedi mi?
